From 0347a6d47e73aa3e08d24cc572d15754666642e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yihou <yihou@amd.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 20:11:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 24/31] [AMD] dsa: Fuse the split decode indexer's pack and
 merge into Triton kernels

Behind SGLANG_DSA_DCP_SPLIT_INDEXER_TRITON (default off, needs
SGLANG_DSA_DCP_SPLIT_DECODE_INDEXER): one launch packs a rank's
(score, position) candidates, one launch merges the gathered W x top-k
candidates by sort and maps positions to KV slots when the top-k is fused,
replacing the per-layer chains of torch elementwise ops and torch.topk.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: yihou <yihou@amd.com>
